        "contenuto_esteso": "A top White House aide is blasting late night comedian Jimmy Kimmel for a joke he made last week about first lady Melania Trump, comments that have sparked both she and President Trump to call for his firing. \"Jimmy Kimmel is a s--- human being for: Making a disgusting joke about assassinating the President ......"
